# A wreck and the race's end (spec M4c): mines.scenario's way to the blast with the test game
# at 99 % damage and one mine (--save 0:FILE): the car backed over its own mine is wrecked and
# burns; 300 ticks on the race is over, its box flies in, Return, the box flies apart and the
# view tilts away. A shot every 100 ms; run with --no-ai --watch.
